      "name": "@duke-dsh-plugins/dsh-remote-control",
      "title": {
        "en": "DSH Pocket",
        "zh": "DSH Pocket 手机遥控"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Control DeepSeek Harness from your phone: sessions, prompts, streamed replies, approvals, images and model switching over an E2E-encrypted relay. Fail-open by design. The relay can also be installed standalone (@duke-dsh-plugins/dsh-remote-control-relay) for VPS deployment.",
        "zh": "在手机上遥控 DeepSeek Harness：会话、发送提示词、流式回复、审批应答、图片与模型切换，全程端到端加密。审批缺省放行（fail-open）。中继可独立安装（@duke-dsh-plugins/dsh-remote-control-relay）部署到 VPS。"
      },
      "icon": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MoonlitDropOfBlood/dsh-remote-control/main/plugin/icon.svg",
